rooterm (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added: Preferences as its own process (`rooterm --preferences`); live updates on main via D-Bus
  * Added: Keyboard shortcuts page (toggle, search, new terminal / SSH, tabs, copy / paste, …)
  * Added: VTE colour themes: background category, foreground theme, live preview
  * Added: Font page: monospace family (or system) and size, with live preview
  * Added: Work-area full screen (tab strip on top, animated; session-only until you exit)
  * Added: Restore local terminal tabs on startup (cwd in `connections.json`; skip missing dirs)
  * Added: Remember last tab per GNOME workspace (on show after hide; optional, default on)
  * Added: VTE right-click menu (copy, paste, select all, full screen, quit, …)
  * Added: `Ctrl+Shift+T` always a local terminal; `Ctrl+Shift+S` a new SSH tab for the focused host
  * Added: Double-click empty tab-bar space for a new local terminal
  * Added: Add group from the tree; default **All** group on a blank install
  * Added: Confirm quit when terminals are still open
  * Added: Tab close countdown with cancel (selected or background)
  * Added: RPM and AppImage packaging alongside the existing Debian workflow
  * Changed: GNOME Shell extension owns show / hide / stacking for main and preferences
  * Changed: Chrome settings live in `config.json`; hosts stay in `connections.json`
  * Changed: Tab strip chrome and close behaviour
  * Fixed: Copy and paste in the terminal
  * Fixed: Duplicate Localhost rows on load
  * Fixed: Drop-down show / hide reliability (X11 and Wayland)
  * Fixed: Preferences startup and live `config_update`
  * Fixed: Closing tabs and tab-bar width feedback

 -- Alan Knowles <alan@roojs.com>  Sun, 16 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

rooterm (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added: Initial packaging

 -- Alan Knowles <alan@roojs.com>  Thu, 06 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

rooterm (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added: GTK4 + Libadwaita + VTE SSH host manager and terminal (Vala)
  * Added: Host tree with per-host terminal tabs and per-tab session icons
  * Added: Multi-connection tab bar for several sessions to the same host
  * Added: Guake-style drop-down via optional GNOME Shell extension (global toggle, panel menu)
  * Added: libsecret-backed passwords and SSH key passphrases
  * Added: JSON config under `~/.config/rooterm/`; Ásbrú `asbru.yml` import on first run
  * Added: Host search pulldown (`Ctrl+Shift+O`)
  * Added: Local port forwards; SSH key create / install / replace / retire helpers
  * Added: Local PTY tabs; optional `sudo -i` (and LXC-host helpers) after login
  * Added: Debian packaging (`debian/`) and GitHub Actions release workflow for `.deb` builds on `v*` tags

 -- Alan Knowles <alan@roojs.com>  Sat, 01 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
